  "ALL_TEXT": "37 INT. TV CHANNEL OFFICE-PCR - DAY \nGANAPATHI is watching different news broadcasts on a set of \nmonitors. \nThey all play the same story - that two terrorists have been \ncaught by the police the day before. SULOCHANA walks up next \nto him, seeming confident. \nSULOCHANA \nEnti Sir, full khushi lo \nunattunnaaru, report \nadiripoinattundi, TRP oo range lo \nunnattundi \nGANAPATHI \nNinna enta mandi terrorists \ndorikaaru SULOCHANA \nSULOCHANA \nIddaru Sir \nGANAPATHI \nMari mugguru ani report enduku \nichaavu? \nSULOCHANA \nTRP peregaali kada sir. Andaru \nichindi manamu iste ela pergutundi \nSir. \nGANAPATHI \nIndaake Commissioner vachaaru, \ninkokadu dorakkapote nene aa moodo \nvadinani nannu teskellipotaaru \nSULOCHANA \nNenu Commissioner gaari to \nmatlaadana? \nGANAPATHI \noddu oddu oddu...Nuvvu dayachesi \nikkadaninchi ellipo amma...Ninnu \ncrime ninchi page 3 ki shift \nchesaanu. \nGANAPATHI \nSHAM GOPAL VERMA gaaru akkada pub \nlo party chestunaaru, film success \nayyindanta, akkada elli aa news \ncover cheyyi \nSULOCHANA \nAdi kaadu sir, inkoka saari \naalochiste \nGANAPATHI \nAalochistene office Jubilee Hills \nninchi Moti Nagar ki \nvachindi...inka aalochiste adhi \nundadhu... \nCUT TO:",
